{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The $855 standard result (SRC_004) depends on the $909 premium-only variant (SRC_002) being algebraically distinct, since 40×18 + 7×27 = 855 ≠ 909 = 47×18 + 7×9. The two are compatible with the same base rate and multiplier but differ in whether the base rate is replaced or supplemented for overtime hours. It is refuted if the premium-only method is shown to be legally equivalent to the standard replacement method in this context.","id":"d8fcb5a87832a131f25fd2f121decd4644bfb6110b0a331f0e7954796a068ca8","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@4796ddef8e78","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"190d009cd72e00fbb3dc1ecbd265cb7adf1d3ae039633692ddc7ca6427a1faa8"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8009aaf8b86019ab6b214a7c8eaa3050ad1690df2ee5b1a619da7f9d8bb7d03e"},{"role":"dependence","target":"81839e92e145d819d054f0962772e584eb980bad7cefeeef65b4e425e00f2ac7"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8855df36b2d51b25417756775b677498254ded7ccb5e6a68749fa2e45cf02053"},{"role":"dependence","target":"abcfb05e5b80c0829e2e9901f4bf27462ba44e8701a3eba0640eff2b882c840d"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8929789f0ae19d5b1c2537f758719daf17f9908ce1fb0ca3fa0cc60fe9f2a2a3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"41e52b9c5a9c1dd86ba4b16afee4f20385d84cb6605d676057dbdc19ae5ea66c"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":716,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-3"},"warrants":[]},"id":"d8fcb5a87832a131f25fd2f121decd4644bfb6110b0a331f0e7954796a068ca8","schema":"artifact"}